jekt  red  did pay me full disclosure  no issue disclosing that and i am yeah  so stoked to be a part of this  i wonder if i could pull off a cosplay  of myself  because that would rule but yes mostly  this is very exciting for me and also  very exciting to be able to share with  you  uh because now anytime that i talk about  this game i can just say that  you'd be like full disclosure i'm in the  game which  related i am hosting the official uh  twitch pre and post show i believe  for the night city wire that's airing  tomorrow  i have no idea what's in the night city  wire i'm just as excited as everyone  else's to find out what's in this game  cause i'm hyped about it  uh but that will be on twitch.tv gaming  starts pretty early actually um i am  recording this a couple of days in  advance so i will let you guys know in a  pinned comment  below of the exact details because i  don't have them right now  but i believe this one is mostly focused  on the soundtrack which is something i'm  very excited to learn more about  super cool but yeah that's pretty much  it for me i think i've covered  everything just  um very nice to be able to share this  and have like this weight off where i  can actually finally talk about it  but also to just share my excitement for  how awesome this is  and um just also say the cd projekt red  team  just also seemed excited to work with me  which was really cool they were so  passionate  and excitable and enthusiastic like from  my involvement in this but also the  hands-on previews to just show off their  game  and this studio more than any other  studio that i've had any kind of  relationship with i think  i just feel like want their game to be  perfect so bad they really care about it  being  as perfect as it possibly can be and i  respect the hell out of them for that so  hopefully i didn't screw it up with my  you know media voice acting hopefully  it's wild to me to think that i will be  in the credits for this game  i will be in t